- [will_said] WAVELET 3 FOCUS: "this week will focus on streamlining work on both of our ends, and containerizing the ecosystem into podman." (Podman census + ratified plan first — podman ABSENT on Rock Mountain.) 70K target stands, subordinated. CADENCE: "for wavelets going forward, we will iterate on the following week plan daily and then just focus on execution." META-RULE: a request repeating across days gets a why-analysis and a mechanism fix.
