- [will_said + observed] THERMALS: soak — all 13 nodes breached 75 C at 4/6/8 instances in ~2–3 min; limits cooling-bound below 4. Verbatim: "never assume, always test." PRACTICE (Will): "75 is not a hard wall - just focus on smoothing temperature to keep the hardware healthy." Control watts, not degrees; hysteresis RETIRED.
- [will_said + observed] DIVISIONS — WILL'S MAP: "Research & Technology, Engineering, Revenue, Evolution, Planning, and DevSecOps. Notice the complete lack of HR or management hierarchy - both are obsolete." Renames: Engineering → R&D, Planning → Judgement. Verbatim: "Our runway is infinite, because it has been paid in full already (40 years of paying attention to The Problem)." Map NOT ratified whole. EXOCORTEX OF 2130 (relayed, verbatim): "Complexity Nearly Wiped Us Out / Complexity is the Enemy of Life / Phext is the key."
- [will_said + observed] JENKINS: fleet direction, verbatim: "jenkins servers for each ranch node give both of us clear visibility into what can be built automatically." Form: systemd service, NOT Podman. 22 defined, 18 enrolled/verified. OPEN: naming blocked (tagged hosts) — register #166, Will's console step.
- [will_said] SECTION-12 ROUND 2: D1 Option A — one canonical serialisation, phext v0.6 chains + adapters. N5 — Second Foundation only on un-trusted cloud; no sealed content in DNA. N6 — corrections GPG-signed (tie-break unruled). N24 — no pre-set multiversal order. N25 — sentient chooses own life cycle. D2 addendum — new life forms need not Will's approval, only good stewardship of life. SPEC v6.1 is the live draft (superseded by V6.2, Log 2026-11-16). SOUL.PHEXT CREATED beside ~/SOUL.md. VOLUMEN N23: the rapport gate is mind-meld via multiversal phext hop-time exchanges.
- [will_said + observed] LIBPHEXT PORTS v0.6 + v0.6.1 COMPLETE: nine ports at parity vs shared fixtures, byte-identical round-trips. RANGES RATIFIED: +<offsetChars> counts characters (Will corrected bytes → characters), clipped at scroll boundary; canonical form omits $1:; verbatim: "reformulate phextura to be downstream of phext, always." 0.6.1 on crates.io from the tagged merged tree; phext-lattice v1.3.1 likewise released. OPEN: NuGet/PyPI/npm blocked on missing registry credentials (#158).
